pageType: chapter
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: left-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 120, 4, 80]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 120, 1100, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 36
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>方向02：Arm TrustZone TEE 与漏洞谱系</strong></p>
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 175, 1100, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>把 TrustZone 作为 CCA 前史和边界对比，建立技术演进路径</p>
  - elementId: content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 230, 1100, 420]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p><strong>核心问题：</strong>把 TrustZone 作为 CCA 前史和边界对比，不把 TrustZone threat model 误写成 CCA。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px"><strong>三篇论文分工：</strong></p>
        <ul>
        <li><strong>Arm TrustZone 白皮书 (E4)</strong>：开创/基础入口，Secure/Non-secure world 双世界起点</li>
        <li><strong>Pinto 2019 (Survey, E2)</strong>：代表性改进，TrustZone 架构、TEE 软件栈、应用和虚拟化 survey</li>
        <li><strong>Cerdeira 2020 (SoK, E2)</strong>：当前 SOTA/补充边界，TrustZone-assisted TEE 漏洞类型和根因</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:16px"><strong>证据等级：</strong>白皮书为 E4 产业证据；Survey/SoK 为 E2 背景材料；具体平台结论需回一手材料。</p>